Dialogue: 50,0:01:56.60,0:01:58.47,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Çıkış yakın!
Dialogue: 50,0:01:58.47,0:02:00.89,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Yolumuzu açıp dümdüz gideceğiz!
Dialogue: 50,0:02:00.89,0:02:01.89,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 50,0:02:01.89,0:02:02.64,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 50,0:02:02.64,0:02:05.27,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 50,0:02:24.25,0:02:27.09,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Tamam! Deniz treni çıktı!
Dialogue: 50,0:02:27.09,0:02:30.34,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Beyler, harekete geçelim!
Dialogue: 50,0:02:30.34,0:02:33.01,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 50,0:02:33.01,0:02:35.84,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Atlayın, Sodom ve Gomorrah!
Dialogue: 50,0:02:37.30,0:02:38.51,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,O da ne?!
Dialogue: 50,0:02:41.35,0:02:44.48,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\an8}Hasır Şapka-san!
Dialogue: 50,0:02:44.48,0:02:48.06,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\an8}Bizi de yanınıza aldığınız için...
Dialogue: 50,0:02:48.52,0:02:52.07,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\q\an8}...tüm Franky Ailesi adına teşekkür ederim!
Dialogue: 50,0:02:52.07,0:02:54.15,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\an8}Bağlantı toplarını ateşleyin!
Dialogue: 50,0:03:04.54,0:03:07.00,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Vay! Müthiş!
Dialogue: 50,0:03:07.38,0:03:10.84,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Bunlar birinci sınıf kral boğa türü.
Dialogue: 50,0:03:10.84,0:03:12.88,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Süper!
Dialogue: 50,0:03:15.05,0:03:18.22,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Kahretsin, bu pislikler...
Dialogue: 50,0:03:18.22,0:03:20.10,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Bu kadar gözü kara olmayın!
Dialogue: 50,0:03:20.10,0:03:22.56,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,– Biz de varız!\N– Biz de varız!
Dialogue: 50,0:03:24.85,0:03:27.23,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Raylar epeyce kaymış gibi görünüyor.
Dialogue: 50,0:03:27.69,0:03:33.53,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Ama deniz treni yapıldığından beri \Nonu yöneten beni, hafife almayın!
Dialogue: 50,0:03:37.91,0:03:38.82,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,İşte!
Dialogue: 50,0:03:38.82,0:03:40.16,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Gidelim!
Dialogue: 50,0:03:43.87,0:03:46.37,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Kazan dairesinden acil durum çağrısı.
Dialogue: 50,0:03:46.37,0:03:50.46,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Raylara bağlandığımızda hızımız sürekli artacak!
Dialogue: 50,0:03:50.46,0:03:54.46,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Sıkı tutunun ki ufak sıyrıklarla atlatabilesiniz.
Dialogue: 50,0:03:54.46,0:03:56.84,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Demek her halukârda yaralanacağız.
Dialogue: 50,0:04:06.23,0:04:07.35,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hadi!
Dialogue: 50,0:04:07.35,0:04:08.52,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Dediğimi yap!
Dialogue: 50,0:04:08.52,0:04:10.61,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Nine, neredeyse, neredeyse!
Dialogue: 50,0:04:10.61,0:04:12.37,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Biraz daha sağa!
Dialogue: 50,0:04:14.69,0:04:15.74,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,İzleyin!
Dialogue: 50,0:04:15.74,0:04:17.36,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Bu kez–
Dialogue: 50,0:04:17.36,0:04:18.07,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Ha?!
Dialogue: 50,0:04:18.07,0:04:20.53,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Chimney! Gonbe!
Dialogue: 50,0:04:21.78,0:04:24.29,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Bizimle mi geldiniz?!
Dialogue: 50,0:04:25.41,0:04:26.95,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Geldik!
Dialogue: 50,0:04:29.96,0:04:31.63,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Ne felaket ama!
Dialogue: 50,0:04:31.63,0:04:33.25,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Çabuk içeri girin!
Dialogue: 50,0:04:33.88,0:04:35.80,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Uçup gideceksiniz!
Dialogue: 50,0:04:36.38,0:04:37.97,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Bir şey olmaz!
Dialogue: 50,0:04:40.72,0:04:41.89,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Chimney!
Dialogue: 50,0:04:44.14,0:04:45.35,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Düşüyorum!
Dialogue: 50,0:04:45.35,0:04:48.23,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Sakın bırakma!
Dialogue: 50,0:04:48.23,0:04:51.00,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Uçup gideceğim!
Dialogue: 50,0:04:51.94,0:04:53.52,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,D-Dur biraz!
Dialogue: 50,0:04:53.52,0:04:55.19,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hemen treni durduracağım!
Dialogue: 50,0:05:01.41,0:05:02.66,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Sahi!
Dialogue: 50,0:05:02.66,0:05:05.91,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Frenler bunda işe yaramıyor!
Dialogue: 50,0:05:09.41,0:05:11.83,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Ne? Bu eğlenceli görünüyor!
Dialogue: 50,0:05:12.83,0:05:14.71,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hasır Şapkalı Abi!
Dialogue: 50,0:05:14.71,0:05:15.90,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hey!
Dialogue: 50,0:05:16.75,0:05:19.67,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hasır Şapka! Onları hemen içeri getir!
Dialogue: 50,0:05:20.05,0:05:23.72,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Raylara bindiğimizde uçup gideceksiniz!
Dialogue: 50,0:05:24.18,0:05:24.89,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Tamam!
Dialogue: 50,0:06:02.26,0:06:03.84,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,– Öleceğimi sandım!\N– Öleceğimi sandım!
Dialogue: 50,0:06:04.34,0:06:06.68,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Elbette öyle!
Dialogue: 50,0:06:06.68,0:06:09.68,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Uçup gideceksiniz demedim mi?
Dialogue: 50,0:06:09.68,0:06:10.81,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 50,0:06:10.81,0:06:13.94,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Ama ne şok edici bir hızlanma.
Dialogue: 50,0:06:13.94,0:06:14.77,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Üff.
Dialogue: 50,0:06:14.77,0:06:16.90,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Gerçekten bizi korkuttu.
Dialogue: 50,0:06:16.90,0:06:18.90,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Sırtımı acıttım.
Dialogue: 50,0:06:19.40,0:06:20.69,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Durun biraz...
Dialogue: 50,0:06:20.69,0:06:23.11,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Burada tuhaf adamlar var.
Dialogue: 50,0:06:23.45,0:06:24.95,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,– Ne?! Kimmiş onlar?!\N– Ne?! Kimmiş onlar?!
Dialogue: 50,0:06:24.95,0:06:26.24,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Sizsiniz!
Dialogue: 50,0:06:26.24,0:06:27.58,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Sen de!
Dialogue: 50,0:06:30.29,0:06:33.75,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Ne kadar uğraştıysak sizi durduramadık.
Dialogue: 50,0:06:34.12,0:06:37.25,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Fazlasıyla geri almak istediğiniz\Narkadaşınızı elinde tutan düşmanlar,...
Dialogue: 50,0:06:37.25,0:06:41.51,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,...benim için de Iceburg-san'ın\Nhayatına kasteden kişilerdir.
Dialogue: 50,0:06:41.84,0:06:45.18,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Ayrıca onlara söylemek istediğim çok şey var!
Dialogue: 50,0:06:46.43,0:06:49.06,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Paulie, yalnız gitmene izin vermeyeceğiz!
Dialogue: 50,0:06:49.06,0:06:53.43,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Senin peşinden ayrılmazsak, Iceburg-san'ın düşmanlarını bulacağımızı düşündük.
Dialogue: 50,0:06:53.43,0:06:55.73,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Bu yüzden ikimiz de kömürlüğe saklandık!
Dialogue: 50,0:06:55.73,0:06:58.40,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Ve... haklıymışız gibi görünüyor.
Dialogue: 50,0:06:58.77,0:07:01.69,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Bu dövüşte size katılacağız.
Dialogue: 50,0:07:02.03,0:07:04.15,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Elbette bu düşman,...
Dialogue: 50,0:07:04.15,0:07:06.74,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,...Franky abiyi de götürdü.
Dialogue: 50,0:07:06.74,0:07:10.95,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Evet! Bunu kimin yaptığını kesinlikle biliyoruz.
Dialogue: 50,0:07:10.95,0:07:14.75,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Abimize bir şey olursa bunun\Nbedelini nasıl ödeyeceksiniz?!
Dialogue: 50,0:07:14.75,0:07:15.75,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Sessiz olun!
Dialogue: 50,0:07:15.75,0:07:18.13,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Bundan en fazla zarar gören kişi, Iceburg-san!
Dialogue: 50,0:07:18.75,0:07:20.75,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hey! Siz neden bahsediyorsunuz?!
Dialogue: 50,0:07:20.75,0:07:23.76,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Paulie, önce bize ne olduğunu açıkla!
Dialogue: 50,0:07:23.76,0:07:25.47,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Evet, Paulie.
Dialogue: 50,0:07:25.47,0:07:28.34,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Asıl suçluları biliyorsun, değil mi?
Dialogue: 50,0:07:28.34,0:07:30.35,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Bunu senin ağzından duymak istiyoruz.
Dialogue: 50,0:07:30.35,0:07:32.64,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,O kadar kalın kafalı değiliz.
Dialogue: 50,0:07:32.64,0:07:34.27,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Kendi şüphelerimiz de var.
Dialogue: 50,0:07:34.60,0:07:36.69,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Şaşırmayacağız.
Dialogue: 50,0:07:37.90,0:07:42.15,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Evet, muhtemelen sebepsiz yere\Naniden kaybolduklarında anlamışsınızdır.
Dialogue: 50,0:07:42.15,0:07:44.49,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,O zaman açıkça söyleyeyim.
Dialogue: 50,0:07:44.49,0:07:47.91,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Maskeli adamların kimliği;...
Dialogue: 50,0:07:47.91,0:07:52.79,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,...Lucci, Kaku, Kalifa ve Barmen Blueno.
Dialogue: 50,0:07:53.29,0:07:57.25,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Iceburg-san'ı öldürmeye çalıştılar.
Dialogue: 50,0:07:59.13,0:08:00.96,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Bunu anlamadınız mı?!
Dialogue: 50,0:08:00.96,0:08:03.67,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,A-Ama memleketlerine gittiler demiştin!
Dialogue: 50,0:08:03.67,0:08:05.09,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Bu durumda giderler miydi sanki?!
Dialogue: 50,0:08:05.09,0:08:08.18,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Arka sokak bölgesinden Michael\Nve Hoichael olduğunu sanmıştık!
Dialogue: 50,0:08:08.18,0:08:08.93,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Evet, evet!
Dialogue: 50,0:08:08.93,0:08:09.84,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Onlar da kim?!
Dialogue: 50,0:08:09.84,0:08:12.43,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,N-Ne?! Bilmiyor musun?!
Dialogue: 50,0:08:12.43,0:08:14.02,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Arka sokaklarda meşhurdurlar!
Dialogue: 50,0:08:14.02,0:08:15.06,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Evet, evet!
Dialogue: 50,0:08:15.06,0:08:17.06,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Nereden bileyim?! Dahası siz-
Dialogue: 50,0:08:17.06,0:08:17.94,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Tamam!
Dialogue: 50,0:08:17.94,0:08:19.94,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Üff, çok yedim.
Dialogue: 50,0:08:19.94,0:08:21.86,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Nihayet tamamen doydum.
Dialogue: 50,0:08:24.40,0:08:25.94,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Pekâla...
Dialogue: 50,0:08:26.78,0:08:30.11,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Franky Ailesi ve Galey-La marangozlarıyla...
Dialogue: 50,0:08:30.53,0:08:35.29,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,...şehirde başımız çok derde girdi.\NAma şimdiyse düşmanımız aynı.
Dialogue: 50,0:08:35.79,0:08:40.23,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Dövüşeceklerimiz içinde, güvercin adam en güçlüsü.
Dialogue: 50,0:08:40.23,0:08:43.00,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Kesinlikle onun canına okuyacağım!
Dialogue: 50,0:08:43.00,0:08:44.63,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Doğru.
Dialogue: 50,0:08:44.63,0:08:48.38,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Bu, onların bizden aldıklarını\Ngeri almak için bir mücadele.
Dialogue: 50,0:08:48.38,0:08:52.60,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Şimdilik, onlara erişmezsek hiçbir şey çözülmez.
Dialogue: 50,0:08:53.85,0:08:57.21,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Nine, nine! Bu Aqua Laguna!
Dialogue: 50,0:08:57.85,0:09:00.19,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Ah?! Çok erken ortaya çıktı.
Dialogue: 50,0:09:00.19,0:09:01.56,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Chimney, izin ver bakayım.
Dialogue: 50,0:09:06.78,0:09:07.74,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Durum kötü!
Dialogue: 50,0:09:08.28,0:09:11.20,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Kokoro-san, şimdi dümeni bırakmak doğru mu?!
Dialogue: 50,0:09:11.20,0:09:13.53,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Bir şekilde o dev dalgayı geçmeliyiz!
Dialogue: 50,0:09:14.41,0:09:15.41,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Söylemiştim.
Dialogue: 50,0:09:15.41,0:09:17.87,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Roket Adam kontrol edilemez.
Dialogue: 50,0:09:17.87,0:09:21.75,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Ne dümen, ne de frenler işe yaramıyor.
Dialogue: 50,0:09:22.12,0:09:25.38,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Benim işim treni raylara bağlamaktı.
Dialogue: 50,0:09:25.96,0:09:28.76,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Tren zaten tam gaz gidiyor.
Dialogue: 50,0:09:29.26,0:09:31.63,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Onu artık kimse durduramaz.
Dialogue: 50,0:09:31.63,0:09:32.76,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Olamaz.
Dialogue: 50,0:09:32.76,0:09:33.64,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Luffy!
Dialogue: 50,0:09:33.97,0:09:37.39,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Bu durumda tren o koca dalgalara çarpacak! Hey, Luffy-
Dialogue: 50,0:09:41.23,0:09:43.85,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hepimiz aynı yöne gittiğimize göre,...
Dialogue: 50,0:09:43.85,0:09:46.52,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,...düşene dek birlikte dövüşmememiz\Niçin bir neden yok!
Dialogue: 50,0:09:46.52,0:09:47.82,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Evet.
Dialogue: 50,0:09:47.82,0:09:49.19,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Doğru!
Dialogue: 50,0:09:51.20,0:09:53.66,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Dinleyin. Biz dostuz.
Dialogue: 50,0:09:54.12,0:09:58.16,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Arkadaşlarımız ilk deniz treninde!
Dialogue: 50,0:09:58.16,0:10:00.62,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Dövüş ihtimali gittikçe artıyor!
Dialogue: 50,0:10:03.67,0:10:04.92,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Beyler!
Dialogue: 50,0:10:04.92,0:10:07.38,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Büyük dalgalar tarafından yenilemeyiz!
Dialogue: 50,0:10:07.38,0:10:10.05,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hepiniz amacınıza ulaşın!
Dialogue: 50,0:10:10.42,0:10:11.55,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,GİDELİM!
Dialogue: 50,0:10:11.55,0:10:14.84,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,– Evet!\N– Evet!
Dialogue: 50,0:10:17.14,0:10:18.26,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Çocuklar!
Dialogue: 50,0:10:18.26,0:10:20.68,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Şu dalga konusunda bir şey yapın!
Dialogue: 50,0:10:20.68,0:10:24.27,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Tamam! Elimizdeki tüm topları ateşleyin!
Dialogue: 50,0:10:24.27,0:10:27.23,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Topları bana bırakın!
Dialogue: 50,0:10:27.57,0:10:30.15,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Franky Ailesi! \NDalgalar karşısında tereddüte düşmeyin!
Dialogue: 50,0:10:30.48,0:10:31.86,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Topları hazırlayın!
Dialogue: 50,0:10:31.86,0:10:33.07,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,– Anlaşıldı!\N– Anlaşıldı!
Dialogue: 50,0:10:34.70,0:10:36.37,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Aylaklık etmeyin!
Dialogue: 50,0:10:36.37,0:10:38.37,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,– Evet!\N– Evet!
Dialogue: 50,0:10:49.63,0:10:51.26,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Bebek Den-Den Mushi çalıyor!
Dialogue: 50,0:11:07.40,0:11:09.11,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hey, sen!
Dialogue: 50,0:11:09.11,0:11:11.23,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Evet, Kaptan T-Bone!
Dialogue: 50,0:11:11.57,0:11:13.61,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Kolun nasıl yaralandı?
Dialogue: 50,0:11:15.11,0:11:15.95,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Ah...
Dialogue: 50,0:11:15.95,0:11:19.95,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Böcek ısırığını kaşıyınca oldu.
Dialogue: 50,0:11:19.95,0:11:22.41,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hiç iyi değil! \NKanamayı hemen durdurmalıyız!
Dialogue: 50,0:11:24.75,0:11:26.37,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Bunu kullanarak dayanmaya çalış.
Dialogue: 50,0:11:26.37,0:11:28.88,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hayır! Değerli pelerininizi kullanmayın!
Dialogue: 50,0:11:30.59,0:11:31.96,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Şimdi iyi olmalı.
Dialogue: 50,0:11:31.96,0:11:36.68,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Adamlarımın kanı akarken, kalbim sızlıyor.
Dialogue: 50,0:11:37.72,0:11:39.05,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Kaptan T-Bone...
Dialogue: 50,0:11:40.39,0:11:46.89,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\q2}Bugün dünyanın huzur dolu olması için dua ediyorum.
Dialogue: 50,0:11:50.02,0:11:52.40,Thoughts-207+,,0,0,0,,– Ne korkunç bir surat.\N– Ne korkunç bir surat.
Dialogue: 50,0:11:53.03,0:11:53.94,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Kaptan!
Dialogue: 50,0:11:53.94,0:11:55.32,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Ne dedin?!
Dialogue: 50,0:11:56.45,0:11:59.49,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,H-Henüz bir şey demedim.
Dialogue: 50,0:11:59.82,0:12:04.87,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Yapabileceğim bir şey varsa,\Nbedenimi feda etmem gerekse bile,...
Dialogue: 50,0:12:06.58,0:12:08.04,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,H-Hayır, efendim.
Dialogue: 50,0:12:08.58,0:12:11.84,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,6. ve 7. vagondaki bütün subayları mahvetmişler!
Dialogue: 50,0:12:11.84,0:12:17.17,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\t(5146,0,1,\c&H000000&\3c&H000000&\4c&H000000&)}Ayrıca iki suçlunun durumu da \Nşu anda bilinmiyor!
Dialogue: 50,0:12:17.34,0:12:18.55,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Ne?!
Dialogue: 50,0:12:19.68,0:12:23.56,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Davetsiz misafir mi var yoksa \Nkendileri mi kaçtılar bilmiyoruz!
Dialogue: 50,0:12:23.56,0:12:24.93,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Bu ne biçim iş?!
Dialogue: 50,0:12:24.93,0:12:29.56,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Adamlarımızın hayatlarını kurtarmalıyız!\NBütün vagonlara durumu bildirin!
Dialogue: 50,0:12:29.56,0:12:30.52,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Emredersiniz!
Dialogue: 50,0:12:32.02,0:12:33.15,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Nami-san!
Dialogue: 50,0:12:33.15,0:12:34.28,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Nami-san, beni duyabiliyor musun?!
Dialogue: 50,0:12:34.28,0:12:36.11,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Evet! Sanji-kun, sen misin?!
Dialogue: 50,0:12:36.53,0:12:40.36,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Burada işler daha da kötüye gidiyor.
Dialogue: 50,0:12:40.36,0:12:41.95,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Kötüye mi gidiyor?
Dialogue: 50,0:12:42.87,0:12:45.33,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Sanji-kun! O ses de neydi?!
Dialogue: 50,0:12:45.33,0:12:47.33,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Hey! Neler oluyor, Sanji-kun?!
Dialogue: 50,0:12:47.33,0:12:48.79,Secondary-207+,,0,0,0,,{\an8}Hey, hey...
Dialogue: 50,0:12:50.29,0:12:52.46,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Evet, hepsi bir aptal yüzünden!
Dialogue: 50,0:12:52.46,0:12:54.00,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\i1}A-Aptal mı?
Dialogue: 50,0:12:54.96,0:12:57.09,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Y-Yine duydum! Nedir o?!
Dialogue: 50,0:12:57.09,0:12:58.34,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Neler oluyor?!
Dialogue: 50,0:12:58.34,0:13:00.05,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Her şey yolunda mı, Sanji-kun?!
Dialogue: 50,0:13:00.05,0:13:01.64,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Aptal kimmiş?!
Dialogue: 50,0:12:56.46,0:12:58.34,Secondary-207+,,0,0,0,,{\an8}İyi misin?
Dialogue: 50,0:12:58.34,0:13:00.05,Secondary-207+,,0,0,0,,{\an8}Şaka yapıyorum.
Dialogue: 50,0:13:00.05,0:13:01.64,Secondary-207+,,0,0,0,,{\an8}Ama paniklemiş görünüyorsun.
Dialogue: 50,0:13:01.64,0:13:03.93,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hayır, iki aptal yüzünden...
Dialogue: 50,0:13:07.35,0:13:09.56,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}Demi-Cannon!
Dialogue: 50,0:13:07.35,0:13:09.56,Attack,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}Yarım-Top
Dialogue: 50,0:13:14.40,0:13:15.65,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,– Al bakalım!\N– Al bakalım!
Dialogue: 50,0:13:17.86,0:13:19.82,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Açıklık oluşturamıyoruz!
Dialogue: 50,0:13:19.82,0:13:21.20,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Elbette...
Dialogue: 50,0:13:21.20,0:13:23.28,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,O şekilde olmaz!
Dialogue: 50,0:13:23.82,0:13:25.41,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Geri durun!
Dialogue: 50,0:13:25.41,0:13:28.70,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Bu işi, Franky Ailesi'nin\Nİhtişamlı Topu'na bırakın!
Dialogue: 50,0:13:30.16,0:13:32.67,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hedef: Aqua Laguna!
Dialogue: 50,0:13:33.29,0:13:34.00,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Ateş!
Dialogue: 50,0:13:34.00,0:13:36.46,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}Super Scrap Cannon!
Dialogue: 50,0:13:34.00,0:13:36.46,Attack,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}Süper Hurda Top
Dialogue: 50,0:13:41.43,0:13:42.97,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Kahretsin!
Dialogue: 50,0:13:42.97,0:13:44.30,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Tereddüt etmeyin!
Dialogue: 50,0:13:44.30,0:13:46.31,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Ateşe devam!
Dialogue: 50,0:13:52.56,0:13:54.23,Secondary-207+,,0,0,0,,{\c&H000000&\3c&H000000&\4c&H000000&\t(19,816,1,\c&HFFFFFF&\3c&H000000&\4c&H000000&)}Daha fazla mühimmat getirin!
Dialogue: 50,0:13:54.23,0:13:54.90,Secondary-207+,,0,0,0,,Tamam!
Dialogue: 50,0:13:54.90,0:13:57.44,Secondary-207+,,0,0,0,,Ön cepheye, aynı noktaya nişan alın!
Dialogue: 50,0:13:57.44,0:14:00.44,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Aynı noktaya ateş edin!
Dialogue: 50,0:14:01.28,0:14:02.24,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Elinizden geleni yapın.
Dialogue: 50,0:14:02.61,0:14:07.87,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Raylar az veya çok yüzeye yükselir\Nama Aqua Laguna'nın üstünden geçemez.
Dialogue: 50,0:14:07.87,0:14:12.12,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Doğrudan çarparsak, \NRoket Adam bile kolayca ezilir.
Dialogue: 50,0:14:13.25,0:14:15.83,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Ölecek miyiz?!
Dialogue: 50,0:14:16.42,0:14:19.05,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hazırlıklı olun demiştim.
Dialogue: 50,0:14:22.05,0:14:24.43,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Ne?! Biz de mi?!
Dialogue: 50,0:14:25.64,0:14:28.43,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Anlıyorum, demek Robin hala...
Dialogue: 50,0:14:30.31,0:14:33.64,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Bu arada, orası da epey hareketli gibi.
Dialogue: 50,0:14:33.64,0:14:35.60,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hey, Sanji-kun.
Dialogue: 50,0:14:36.19,0:14:38.86,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Robin'in öyle davranmasının nedeni...
Dialogue: 50,0:14:39.65,0:14:42.82,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,...ve bizim durumumuz...
Dialogue: 50,0:14:42.82,0:14:45.82,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Kapayın çenenizi!!!
Dialogue: 50,0:14:47.03,0:14:48.83,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Dinle, Sanji-kun.
Dialogue: 50,0:14:48.83,0:14:53.96,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Robin'in tavırları ve şu anki durumumuzun\Nardında yatan sebepleri sana anlatacağım.
Dialogue: 50,0:14:53.96,0:14:55.08,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,İyi dinle.
Dialogue: 50,0:14:56.79,0:14:58.67,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Çarpacağız!
Dialogue: 50,0:14:58.67,0:15:00.21,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Eyvah! Öldük!
Dialogue: 50,0:15:00.21,0:15:01.55,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Öleceğiz!
Dialogue: 50,0:15:01.55,0:15:03.88,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Sızlanacak zamanınız varsa, ateşe devam edin!
Dialogue: 50,0:15:03.88,0:15:05.84,Secondary-207+,,0,0,0,,Bir yol açın!
Dialogue: 50,0:15:09.51,0:15:11.10,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hey, Luffy.
Dialogue: 50,0:15:11.10,0:15:12.31,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Evet...
Dialogue: 50,0:15:12.81,0:15:14.81,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Gidelim, Zoro.
Dialogue: 50,0:15:25.28,0:15:27.49,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hey! Ön cepheye ateşe etmeye devam edin!
Dialogue: 50,0:15:27.49,0:15:29.41,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Ne yapacaksınız?!
Dialogue: 50,0:15:38.42,0:15:40.04,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Bir top...
Dialogue: 50,0:15:41.80,0:15:42.63,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,...ateşleyeceğiz.
Dialogue: 50,0:15:51.81,0:15:54.10,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,İki kere 108 ne eder?!
Dialogue: 50,0:15:54.93,0:15:56.35,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,216.
Dialogue: 50,0:15:56.35,0:16:00.98,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,216 biraz uzun ve söylemesi zor.
Dialogue: 50,0:16:00.98,0:16:03.23,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,İstediğini söyle.
Dialogue: 50,0:16:03.94,0:16:06.57,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Ne yapmaya çalışıyorlar?!
Dialogue: 50,0:16:06.57,0:16:09.20,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Çıplak elle ve kılıçlarla ne yapacaklar?!
Dialogue: 50,0:16:09.20,0:16:10.91,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Ateşe devam etmemizi söylediler.
Dialogue: 50,0:16:10.91,0:16:12.87,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Her neyse! Onlara eşlik edin!
Dialogue: 50,0:16:13.24,0:16:15.25,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,– Evet!\N– Evet!
Dialogue: 50,0:16:15.79,0:16:18.67,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Tamam, o zaman 300!
Dialogue: 50,0:16:19.29,0:16:20.67,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Tamam!
Dialogue: 50,0:16:20.67,0:16:22.67,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}Gomu Gomu no...
Dialogue: 50,0:16:22.67,0:16:25.01,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}Sanbyaku Pound...
Dialogue: 50,0:16:22.67,0:16:25.01,Attack,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}300 Poundluk...
Dialogue: 50,0:16:27.09,0:16:29.59,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,– Çarpacağız!\N– Çarpacağız!
Dialogue: 50,0:16:36.85,0:16:38.27,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}– ...Cannon!\N– ...Cannon!
Dialogue: 50,0:16:36.85,0:16:38.27,Attack,,0,0,0,,...Top
Dialogue: 50,0:17:30.61,0:17:35.78,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,– İ-İçinden geçtik!!!\N– İ-İçinden geçtik!!!
Dialogue: 50,0:17:41.83,0:17:46.34,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,– Aqua Laguna'nın içinden geçtik!!!\N– Aqua Laguna'nın içinden geçtik!!!
Dialogue: 50,0:17:49.67,0:17:51.84,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Öleceğimizi sanmıştım!
Dialogue: 50,0:18:15.87,0:18:18.24,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Hey! Nami-san, iyi misin?!
Dialogue: 50,0:18:18.24,0:18:20.66,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Evet, yeterince şaşırtıcı.
Dialogue: 50,0:18:22.50,0:18:24.25,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Bu gerçekten harikaydı!
Dialogue: 50,0:18:24.25,0:18:27.63,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Görünüşe göre siz korsanlar sadece göstermelik değilsiniz!
Dialogue: 50,0:18:27.96,0:18:30.34,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Düşman olarak korkunç kimseler.
Dialogue: 50,0:18:30.34,0:18:34.72,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Ama dost olarak daha güveniliri olmaz.
Dialogue: 50,0:18:34.72,0:18:35.76,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,– Hasır Şapka!!\N– Hasır Şapka!!
Dialogue: 50,0:18:36.26,0:18:39.01,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Gerçekten ölmeye hazırdım.
Dialogue: 50,0:18:39.01,0:18:40.35,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,İnanılmazlar...
Dialogue: 50,0:18:40.72,0:18:43.06,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Rahatlamayın çocuklar.
Dialogue: 50,0:18:43.06,0:18:45.85,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Henüz fırtınayı atlatmadık.
Dialogue: 50,0:18:45.85,0:18:47.56,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 50,0:18:47.56,0:18:50.03,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Artık hiçbir şeyden korkmuyoruz!
Dialogue: 50,0:18:54.66,0:18:56.28,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Eğlenceliydi!
Dialogue: 50,0:18:56.28,0:18:59.03,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hasır Şapka. Müthişsin!
Dialogue: 50,0:18:59.03,0:19:02.29,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,İnsanlık dışı bir şeydi!
Dialogue: 50,0:19:04.29,0:19:06.38,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Ah, afedersin.
Dialogue: 50,0:19:06.38,0:19:08.00,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Luffy, buraya gel!
Dialogue: 50,0:19:14.38,0:19:15.63,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Sanji-kun.
Dialogue: 50,0:19:16.84,0:19:18.05,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Selam, Luffy.
Dialogue: 50,0:19:18.05,0:19:19.93,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Ah, Sanji!
Dialogue: 50,0:19:19.93,0:19:21.52,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Orada işler nasıl?
Dialogue: 50,0:19:21.52,0:19:22.89,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Robin ne durumda?
Dialogue: 50,0:19:22.89,0:19:26.56,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Robin-chan, hala tutsak.
Dialogue: 50,0:19:27.06,0:19:29.69,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Olup biteni Nami-san'dan duydum.
Dialogue: 50,0:19:30.11,0:19:32.36,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Evet, her şeyi duydum.
Dialogue: 50,0:19:32.36,0:19:33.82,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Anlıyorum.
Dialogue: 50,0:19:34.36,0:19:35.28,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Evet...
Dialogue: 50,0:19:35.99,0:19:38.32,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Ah, demek öyle.
Dialogue: 50,0:19:39.12,0:19:41.03,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Git canlarına oku.
Dialogue: 50,0:19:41.03,0:19:43.33,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Luffy, saçmalama!
Dialogue: 50,0:19:43.33,0:19:45.66,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Biz varana dek beklesin!
Dialogue: 50,0:19:46.50,0:19:48.42,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Hey, aşçı! Beni duyabiliyor musun?!
Dialogue: 50,0:19:48.42,0:19:50.34,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\i1}O trende bazı tehlikeli–
Dialogue: 50,0:19:50.34,0:19:51.63,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Sorun değil.
Dialogue: 50,0:19:51.63,0:19:52.75,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Zoro,...
Dialogue: 50,0:19:53.17,0:19:55.42,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,...sen ne yapardın?
Dialogue: 50,0:19:56.55,0:20:02.22,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Robin'in bizi kurtarmak için yalan\Nsöyleyip yakalandığını duyduğunda,...
Dialogue: 50,0:20:02.72,0:20:04.81,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,...bekleyebilir miydin?
Dialogue: 50,0:20:07.64,0:20:09.48,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Onu durdurmak faydasız.
Dialogue: 50,0:20:10.86,0:20:12.44,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Kesinlikle anlıyorsun.
Dialogue: 50,0:20:12.44,0:20:14.53,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hey, Yosun Kafa!
Dialogue: 50,0:20:14.53,0:20:16.53,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Benim için endişelendin mi?!
Dialogue: 50,0:20:16.53,0:20:17.78,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Hiç de bile! Sersem!
Dialogue: 50,0:20:18.16,0:20:19.70,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Ama ne yazık ki...
Dialogue: 50,0:20:20.53,0:20:24.08,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,...Robin-chan'ın sebeplerini duyduğumda,...
Dialogue: 50,0:20:25.08,0:20:27.62,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,...kaptanın emri bile olsa...
Dialogue: 50,0:20:27.62,0:20:30.04,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,...durmam!
Dialogue: 50,0:20:32.00,0:20:34.13,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Niye kırdın?!
Dialogue: 50,0:20:34.13,0:20:37.34,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hasır Şapka'dan bir şey öğrenmek istiyordum!
Dialogue: 50,0:20:37.34,0:20:39.43,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Ha? Nereden bileyim?
Dialogue: 50,0:20:40.01,0:20:41.76,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Daha önce söylemeliydin.
Dialogue: 50,0:20:41.76,0:20:43.93,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Niye söylemek zorundayım?!
Dialogue: 50,0:20:43.93,0:20:45.68,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Beni görmezden gelme!
Dialogue: 50,0:20:45.68,0:20:47.39,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Geliyorum.
Dialogue: 50,0:20:50.65,0:20:52.65,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Umarım iyilerdir.
Dialogue: 50,0:20:52.65,0:20:55.65,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Nine! Treni daha da hızlandır!
Dialogue: 50,0:20:55.65,0:20:56.65,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Daha fazla mı?
Dialogue: 50,0:20:56.65,0:21:00.91,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Evet! Çooook daha fazla!
Dialogue: 50,0:21:02.62,0:21:04.37,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Rahatla.
Dialogue: 50,0:21:04.37,0:21:08.21,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Geminin maksimum güvenli hız limitini çoktan geçti.
Dialogue: 50,0:21:10.62,0:21:14.25,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Bu kadar hızlıyken, \Nkendi gücümüzle durdurulamaz.
Dialogue: 50,0:21:19.93,0:21:25.35,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Demek tayfayı terkettiğimden beri olanlar bunlar.
Dialogue: 50,0:21:26.06,0:21:28.31,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Robin-chan, Merry'nin durumu veya...
Dialogue: 50,0:21:28.31,0:21:32.65,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,...seninle Luffy arasındaki büyük dövüş hakkında hiçbir şey bilmiyor.
Dialogue: 50,0:21:36.48,0:21:41.49,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Seninle birlikte altımızın, \Ngüvenli bir şekilde ilerleyebilmesi için,...
Dialogue: 50,0:21:41.49,0:21:46.49,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,...Robin-chan kendini feda etti\Nve ona söylendiği gibi davrandı.
Dialogue: 50,0:21:47.24,0:21:49.04,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Bizim için.
Dialogue: 50,0:21:51.79,0:21:55.50,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Ne harika bir hikaye!
Dialogue: 50,0:21:57.75,0:21:59.76,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Niye ağlıyorsun?
Dialogue: 50,0:21:59.76,0:22:02.51,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Aptal! Ağlamıyorum!
Dialogue: 50,0:22:04.47,0:22:07.18,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Kahretsin! Niye?!
Dialogue: 50,0:22:07.18,0:22:12.06,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Nico Robin'in zalim, vahşi bir dişi şeytan olduğu söyleniyordu!
Dialogue: 50,0:22:12.06,0:22:16.57,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Bu duygusal arkadaş özlemi niye?!
Dialogue: 50,0:22:17.44,0:22:19.86,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Robin-chan biraz ileride.
Dialogue: 50,0:22:20.19,0:22:22.40,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Onu kurtaracağım.
Dialogue: 50,0:22:22.40,0:22:23.36,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Tamam!
Dialogue: 50,0:22:23.36,0:22:28.87,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Tamam! Franky Ailesi'nin lideri Franky,\Nsana yardım edecek, Kaş kardeş!
Dialogue: 50,0:22:28.87,0:22:33.92,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\q2}Açıkçası Nico Robin'in hükümet tarafından\Nyakalanmasını engellemek için kendi sebebim var.
Dialogue: 50,0:22:34.37,0:22:37.88,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Ama esasen bu iç burkan hikaye yüzünden.
Dialogue: 50,0:22:37.88,0:22:39.88,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hey! Gidelim, Uzun burun!
Dialogue: 50,0:22:40.42,0:22:41.80,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Ben...
Dialogue: 50,0:22:42.92,0:22:43.72,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,...gelmeyeceğim.
Dialogue: 50,0:22:46.39,0:22:49.14,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Artık benimle hiçbir ilgisi yok, değil mi?
Dialogue: 50,0:22:49.14,0:22:52.31,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Nihayet Dünya Hükümeti'nin\Nkendisi düşmanımız olmuşken,...
Dialogue: 50,0:22:52.31,0:22:54.23,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,...bulaşmak istemiyorum ve...
Dialogue: 50,0:22:55.90,0:22:58.48,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,...Luffyler'le buluşacaksınız, değil mi?
Dialogue: 50,0:22:59.27,0:23:02.11,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Sert sözlerin ve utanç verici davranışın...
Dialogue: 50,0:23:02.11,0:23:04.78,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,...ardından onlarla olabilmem mümkün değil!
Dialogue: 50,0:23:08.49,0:23:10.37,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Robin'e çok yazık...
Dialogue: 50,0:23:10.37,0:23:14.08,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,...ama benim onu kurtarma zorunluluğum yok!
Dialogue: 50,0:23:14.46,0:23:16.21,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Tayfadan ayrıldım!
Dialogue: 50,0:23:22.34,0:23:23.34,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Elveda.
Dialogue: 50,0:23:25.68,0:23:28.14,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,H-Hey! Elveda veya her neyse.
Dialogue: 50,0:23:28.14,0:23:31.77,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Gidecek yerin yok!
Dialogue: 50,0:23:31.77,0:23:32.77,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Sorun değil.
Dialogue: 50,0:23:33.39,0:23:34.52,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Onu boş ver.
Dialogue: 50,0:23:38.15,0:23:40.40,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Aşırı derecede inatçı!
Dialogue: 50,0:23:41.36,0:23:43.28,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hemen bulun onları!
Dialogue: 50,0:23:43.28,0:23:45.74,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Bir tür kanıt olmalı!
Dialogue: 50,0:23:46.57,0:23:47.36,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,B...
Dialogue: 50,0:23:47.70,0:23:48.87,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Bu çok kötü!
Dialogue: 50,0:23:50.83,0:23:52.29,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Lütfen bunun seni korumasına izin ver!
Dialogue: 50,0:23:54.12,0:23:58.21,Main-207+,,0,0,20,,Wanze-san! Trende korkunç şeyler oluyor!
Dialogue: 50,0:23:58.21,0:23:59.33,Main-207+,,0,0,20,,Kapa çeneni!
Dialogue: 50,0:23:59.33,0:24:01.80,Main-207+,,0,0,20,,Burada da korkunç şeyler oluyor!
Dialogue: 50,0:24:03.96,0:24:06.80,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Nero-san! Suçlular kaçtı!
Dialogue: 50,0:24:22.86,0:24:24.07,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Onları buldum!
Dialogue: 50,0:24:24.07,0:24:25.78,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Eyvah!
Dialogue: 50,0:24:25.78,0:24:27.20,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}Metallic Star!
Dialogue: 50,0:24:25.78,0:24:27.20,Attack,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}Metalik Yıldız
Dialogue: 50,0:24:34.49,0:24:36.12,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,– O da kim?!\N– O da kim?!
Dialogue: 50,0:24:43.63,0:24:45.76,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Olup biten her şeyi ondan duydum.
Dialogue: 50,0:24:46.13,0:24:48.76,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Genç bir kadını kurtarmak istiyor gibisiniz.
Dialogue: 50,0:24:49.26,0:24:52.76,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Size yardım etmek için sebebe ihtiyacım yok.
Dialogue: 50,0:24:53.26,0:24:55.22,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Birlikte dövüşelim!
Dialogue: 50,0:25:02.02,0:25:03.44,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Benim adım...
Dialogue: 50,0:25:04.36,0:25:06.03,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Sogeking!
Dialogue: 50,0:25:04.36,0:25:06.03,Note,,0,0,0,,Sogeking: Keskin Nişancılar Kralı
